.TH SYNC 2 "January 2026" "Substrate Kernel" "System Calls Manual"
.SH NAME
sync \- commit buffer cache to disk
.SH LIBRARY
Standard C library (libc, -lc)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <unistd.h>
.PP
.BI "void sync(void);"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B sync()
causes all pending modifications to filesystem metadata and data to be written to the underlying filesystems.
.SH RETURN VALUE
.B sync()
is always successful.

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR intro(2)
